msgid "Use this colour as background:"
msgstr "用這個顏色當背景："

#: mcomix/preferences_dialog.py:138
msgid "Always use this selected colour as the background colour."
msgstr "永遠使用選取的顏色當背景顏色。"

#: mcomix/preferences_dialog.py:139 mcomix/preferences_dialog.py:150
msgid "Use dynamic background colour"
msgstr "使用動態背景顏色"

#: mcomix/preferences_dialog.py:141
msgid "Automatically pick a background colour that fits the viewed image."
msgstr "自動挑選適合觀看中圖片的背景顏色。"

#: mcomix/preferences_dialog.py:148
msgid "Use this colour as the thumbnail background:"
msgstr "用這個顏色當預覽縮圖背景："

#: mcomix/preferences_dialog.py:149
msgid "Always use this selected colour as the thumbnail background colour."
msgstr "永遠使用選取的顏色當預覽縮圖的背景顏色。"

#: mcomix/preferences_dialog.py:152
msgid ""
"Automatically use the colour that fits the viewed image for the thumbnail "
"background."
msgstr "自動挑選適合的顏色當觀看中圖片的預覽縮圖背景顏色。"

#: mcomix/preferences_dialog.py:157
msgid "Show page numbers on thumbnails"
msgstr "在預覽縮圖上顯示頁碼"

#: mcomix/preferences_dialog.py:160
msgid "Thumbnail size (in pixels):"
msgstr "預覽縮圖大小 (像素)："

#: mcomix/preferences_dialog.py:164
msgid "Transparency"
msgstr "透明度"

#: mcomix/preferences_dialog.py:167
msgid "Use checkered background for transparent images"
msgstr "透明色圖片使用方格背景"

#: mcomix/preferences_dialog.py:169
msgid ""
"Use a grey checkered background for transparent images. If this preference "
"is unset, the background is plain white instead."
msgstr "透明色圖片使用灰色方格背景。如果未設定這個項目，則將使用白色背景。"

#: mcomix/preferences_dialog.py:182
msgid "Use smart scrolling"
msgstr "使用智慧型捲動"

#: mcomix/preferences_dialog.py:184
msgid ""
"With this preference set, the space key and mouse wheel do not only scroll "
"down or up, but also sideways and so try to follow the natural reading order "
"of the comic book."
msgstr ""
"通常按空白鍵和滾動滑鼠滾輪時只會上下捲動，但設定這個項目後，也會側向捲動，以"
"儘量配合一般漫畫書的閱讀順序。"

#: mcomix/preferences_dialog.py:189
msgid "Flip pages when scrolling off the edges of the page"
msgstr "當捲動到頁面的頂端或底部時翻頁"

#: mcomix/preferences_dialog.py:191
msgid ""
"Flip pages when scrolling \"off the page\" with the scroll wheel or with the "
"arrow keys. It takes n consecutive \"steps\" with the scroll wheel or the "
"arrow keys for the pages to be flipped."
msgstr ""
"以滾輪或方向鍵捲動到「超出本頁」時翻頁。要翻頁時，需要連續滾動滑鼠滾輪或按方"
"向鍵數次。"

#: mcomix/preferences_dialog.py:194
msgid "Automatically open the next archive"
msgstr "自動開啟下一個壓縮檔"

#: mcomix/preferences_dialog.py:196
msgid ""
"Automatically open the next archive in the directory when flipping past the "
"last page, or the previous archive when flipping past the first page."
msgstr ""
"當在目前壓縮檔翻頁離開最後一頁時，自動開啟目錄中的下一個壓縮檔；當翻頁跳出第"
"一頁時，則自動開啟上一個壓縮檔。"

#: mcomix/preferences_dialog.py:199
msgid "Automatically open next directory"
msgstr "自動開啟下一個目錄"

#: mcomix/preferences_dialog.py:201
msgid ""
"Automatically open the first file in the next sibling directory when "
"flipping past the last page of the last file in a directory, or the previous "
"directory when flipping past the first page of the first file."
msgstr ""
"於所在目錄最後一頁時向後翻頁，則自動開啟下一個目錄的第一個檔案；於第一個檔案"
"的第一頁時向前翻頁，則自動開啟上一個目錄。"

#: mcomix/preferences_dialog.py:204
msgid "Open first file when navigating to previous archive"
msgstr "移到上一個壓縮檔時開啟第一個檔案"

#: mcomix/preferences_dialog.py:206
msgid ""
"Automatically open the first file of the previous archive when navigating to "
"it, instead of opening the last file of the previous archive."
msgstr "移到上一個壓縮檔時，自動開啟它的第一個檔案，而不是最後一個檔案。"

#: mcomix/preferences_dialog.py:209
msgid "Open first file when navigating to previous directory"
msgstr "移到上一個目錄時開啟第一個檔案"

#: mcomix/preferences_dialog.py:211
msgid ""
"Automatically open the first file of the previous directory when navigating "
"to it, instead of opening the last file of the previous directory."
msgstr "移到上一個目錄時，自動開啟它的第一個檔案，而不是最後一個檔案。"

#: mcomix/preferences_dialog.py:213
msgid "Number of pixels to scroll per arrow key press:"
msgstr "按方向鍵時捲動的像數："

#: mcomix/preferences_dialog.py:216
msgid "Set the number of pixels to scroll on a page when using the arrow keys."
msgstr "設定在檢視頁面時每按方向鍵就要捲動多少像數。"

#: mcomix/preferences_dialog.py:218
msgid "Number of pixels to scroll per mouse wheel turn:"
msgstr "使用滑鼠滾輪時要捲動的像數："

#: mcomix/preferences_dialog.py:221
msgid "Set the number of pixels to scroll on a page when using a mouse wheel."
msgstr "設定在檢視頁面時每滾動滑鼠滾輪就要捲動多少像數。"

#: mcomix/preferences_dialog.py:223
msgid "Fraction of page to scroll per space key press (in percent):"
msgstr "按空白鍵時的捲動量 (百分比)："

#: mcomix/preferences_dialog.py:227
msgid ""
"Sets the percentage by which the page will be scrolled down or up when the "
"space key is pressed."
msgstr "設定按空白鍵後頁面捲動量的百分比。"

#: mcomix/preferences_dialog.py:230
msgid "Number of \"steps\" to take before flipping the page:"
msgstr "已捲動到超出頁面時，要再捲動幾次才翻頁："

#: mcomix/preferences_dialog.py:233
msgid ""
"Set the number of \"steps\" needed to flip to the next or previous page.  "
"Less steps will allow for very fast page turning but you might find yourself "
"accidentally turning pages."
msgstr ""
"設定要滾動多少次才翻回上一頁或翻到下一頁，次數少則可以快速瀏覽；你可以多試幾"
"次找出適合自己的設定。"

#: mcomix/preferences_dialog.py:238
msgid "Flip two pages in double page mode"
msgstr "雙頁模式時一次翻兩頁"

#: mcomix/preferences_dialog.py:240
msgid ""
"Flip two pages, instead of one, each time we flip pages in double page mode."
msgstr "雙頁模式時一次翻兩頁，而不是只翻一頁。"

#: mcomix/preferences_dialog.py:242
msgid "Show only one page where appropriate:"
msgstr "在特殊的狀況時只顯示一頁："

#: mcomix/preferences_dialog.py:245
msgid "Page auto-resizing:"
msgstr "頁面自動調整大小："

#: mcomix/preferences_dialog.py:248
msgid "Space between two pages (in pixels):"
msgstr "兩頁之間的間距（像素）："

#: mcomix/preferences_dialog.py:252
msgid "Files"
msgstr "檔案"

#: mcomix/preferences_dialog.py:255
msgid "Automatically open the last viewed file on startup"
msgstr "啟動時自動開啟最後檢視的檔案"

#: mcomix/preferences_dialog.py:257
msgid ""
"Automatically open, on startup, the file that was open when MComix was last "
